@page "/"
<PageTitle>SponsorCheck Setup Wizard</PageTitle>

<p>
    SponsorCheck verifies sponsorship at build time. Pick the side of it that applies —
    each flow asks a few questions and generates exact, copy-pasteable configuration.
</p>

<div class="role-cards">
    <a class="role-card" href="consumer">
        <h2>Consumer</h2>
        <p>
            A build asked for sponsorship metadata (an SC0xx error or warning).
            Generate the snippet and find out exactly which file it belongs in.
        </p>
    </a>
    <a class="role-card" href="author">
        <h2>OSS author</h2>
        <p>
            Add SponsorCheck to a published package: platform accounts, credentials,
            owner mode, exemptions, and release notes for consumers.
        </p>
    </a>
</div>
